# Deny-by-default: every Dockerfile in this repo builds a Maven service, so the
# context is limited to what the reactor needs. Keeps Render builds from shipping
# the 2.8GB web workspace and node_modules trees over the wire.
#
# Render's Docker runtime defaults to ./Dockerfile. `*` would hide that file
# and nested services/**/Dockerfile, which is the 2-byte "open Dockerfile" miss.
*
!Dockerfile
!pom.xml
!mvnw
!mvnw.cmd
!.mvn
!.mvn/**
!config
!config/**
!services
!services/**
!services/**/Dockerfile
!tests
!tests/**

services/**/target
**/.DS_Store
**/*.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env*.example
